Track 2: Braise The Unlucky Ore
- Story & Context: Elara, the crew’s cook, insisted on boiling the day's intake of sulfur-rich gravel as if it were a feast, humming jagged melodies into the steam. When the foreman demanded she return to drilling, she smashed her ladle against his locker, starting a rhythmic riot that turned the entire breakroom into a screaming drum circle. "Pour the grit into the gullet, hunger keeps the motor running."
